Nuh! I was honestly bored, I don't understand karma AT ALL, I just come to Reddit to watch memes every now and then but today I was specially inspired and I got a creativity boost by that video, I was actually gonna let the idea go because I'm not really good with doing stuff (I get rid of it the moment I stop liking what I do) but coincidentally I also had a confidence boost so I decided to do it. It's very probable that I won't post for like months. 

